<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose in June 4 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose in June 4 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED MAY 28</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............815,300 down.....100</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......724,900 up.....5,500</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......547,500 up.....1,400</p>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED JUNE 4</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....865,245 up....12,044</p>
<p> Financial companies.......670,008 up.....8,933</p>
<p> New York business loans....47,624 up.....1,188</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......47,364 up.....1,187</p>
</text>
